  <p>When TechFlow Solutions approached us in early 2025, they faced a challenge that many growing SaaS companies know well: their successful sales process wasn't scaling. What worked for their three-person founding team making 50 calls per week was breaking down as they tried to grow to a 15-person sales organization making 500+ calls weekly.</p>

  <p>Twelve months later, TechFlow has not only achieved that 10x scaling goal—they've exceeded it while dramatically improving their conversion rates, team satisfaction, and revenue per rep. Here's the complete story of how they did it.</p>

  <div class="company-profile">
    <div class="profile-title">TechFlow Solutions at a Glance</div>
    <div class="profile-grid">
