  <h2>The Four-Phase Transformation</h2>

  <p>TechFlow's transformation didn't happen overnight. They implemented changes in four distinct phases over 12 months, with each phase building on the previous one's success.</p>

  <div class="phase-container">
    <div class="phase">
      <div class="phase-header">
        <div class="phase-number">1</div>
        <div class="phase-title">Foundation: Data & Research Automation</div>
      </div>
      <div class="phase-content">
        <p><strong>Timeline:</strong> Months 1-2</p>
        <p><strong>Focus:</strong> Eliminate manual research bottlenecks and standardize prospect data</p>

        <div class="implementation-grid">
          <div class="implementation-card">
            <div class="card-title"><Icon name="search" size={20} /> Automated Research</div>
            <ul>
              <li>AI-powered company analysis</li>
              <li>LinkedIn profile enrichment</li>
              <li>Recent news and trigger events</li>
              <li>Technology stack identification</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="implementation-card">
            <div class="card-title"><Icon name="bar-chart" size={20} /> Data Standardization</div>
            <ul>
              <li>Unified prospect scoring system</li>
              <li>Consistent data formatting</li>
              <li>Automated list hygiene</li>
              <li>CRM integration setup</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p><strong>Results:</strong> Research time reduced from 70% to 5% of calling time. Data quality improved by 85%.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

